"Add a PDF file as a cover for the core sale order report\n"
"\n"
"**Table of contents**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Configuration\n"
"=============\n"
"\n"
"To configure this module, you need to:\n"
"\n"
"1. Go to *Sales > Order > PDF Cover*.\n"
"2. In the \"PDF Cover\" section, add a PDF file to use it as a cover for\n"
"   the core sale order report.\n"
"\n"
"Usage\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"If you wish to print only the core sale order report, uncheck the 'Print\n"
"with Cover' option in the 'Other Info' tab of the sale order.\n"
"\n"
